[3404]="700717E1\n1\tGather blighted flora samples (total: 10)\tSerâna has asked for you gather samples of the blighted flora near Sul Madásh so that she can study them and see how the rot affects different plants.\n2\tReturn the flora samples to Serâna\tYou have gathered samples of the blighted flora outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.\n",
[3405]="70071866\n1\tGather insect samples (total: 10)\tSerâna has asked for you search the waters near Sul Madásh and gather insects found there so that she can study them for signs of blight.\n2\tReturn the insect samples to Serâna\tYou gathered insects from the marsh waters outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.\n",
[3406]="700717E3\n1\tGather tree sap (total: 10)\tSerâna has asked for your help gathering sap from the trees outside of Sul Madásh so that she can study the blight within them.\n2\tReturn the sap samples to Serâna\tYou found blighted sap within the trees outside of Sul Madásh. Return the samples you collected to Serâna.\n",
[3407]="700164C7\n1\tFind the ancient water-wheel\030Defeat creatures at The Great Wheel (total: 6)\tThe water-wheels can be found at The Great Wheel, south-west of the Hulwul-nefekh. Ansurr challenged you to find a great water-wheel in the Water-works which is no longer working. Once found, he wants you to clear out some of the creatures nearby to secure it.\n2\tTalk to Ansurr in Hulwul-nefekh\tAnsurr is in Hulwul-nefekh, north-east of The Great Wheel. Ansurr will be pleased to hear you located and secured the water-wheel.\n",
[3408]="70054CFF\n1\tDefeat Orcs from either army in the Circle of Wrath (total: 20)\tTwo Orc armies inhabit the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul. You should venture forth and defeat Orcs from either army.\n2\tTalk to Thornaran\tReturn to Thornaran and tell him you successfully defeated Orcs in Minas Morgul.\n",
[3409]="70054D00\n1\tDefeat one of Gothmog's captains in Zhar Dushgoi\tA powerful host of Orcs makes camp within Zhar Dushgoi. You should seek out one of the captains in Zhar Dushgoi and defeat him.\n2\tTalk to Thornaran\tReturn to Thornaran and inform him that you defeated an Orc captain in Zhar Dushgoi.\n",
[3410]="70054D01\n1\tDefeat goblin-scouts (total: 12)\tTwo Orc armies inhabit the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul. You should venture forth and defeat goblin-scouts within the encampments.\n2\tTalk to Thornaran\tReturn to Thornaran and tell him you defeated goblin-scouts in the Circle of Wrath.\n",
[3411]="70054D03\n1\tDefeat Orc sergeants in either encampment (total: 3)\tTwo Orc armies inhabit the Circle of Wrath in Minas Morgul. You should venture forth and defeat sergeants in either encampment.\n2\tTalk to Thornaran\tReturn to Thornaran and tell him you defeated Orcs in Minas Morgul.\n",
[3412]="70054D02\n1\tDefeat one of Ugrukhôr's captains at Zhar Skator\tA powerful host of Orcs camps within the Circle of Wrath, in Zhar Skator. You should seek out and defeat one of the Orc-captains.\n2\tTalk to Thornaran\tYou should return to Thornaran with news of your victory over the Orc-captain.\n",
[3413]="70019D2D\n1\tMeditate in the Peaceful Glade\tThe Peaceful Glade lies north of Egladil. Galhíril suggested you meditate in the Peaceful Glade.\n2\tThe Peaceful Glade lies north of Egladil. Galhíril suggested you meditate in the Peaceful Glade.\t\n3\tMeditate in the Ring of Melbrethil\tThe Ring of Melbrethil lies to the north of the Peaceful Glade. Galhíril suggested that you meditate within the Ring of Melbrethil.\n4\tThe Ring of Melbrethil lies to the north of the Peaceful Glade. Galhíril suggested that you meditate within the Ring of Melbrethil.\t\n5\tMeditate in the Stone-grove\tThe Stone-grove lies well to the south-west of the Ring of Melbrethil. Galhíril suggested that you meditate within the Stone-grove.\n6\tThe Stone-grove lies far to the south-west of the Ring of Melbrethil. Galhíril suggested that you meditate within the Stone-grove.\t\n7\tMeditate in the Elder Circle\tThe Elder Circle lies to the south-east of the Stone-grove. Glahíril suggested that you meditate within the Elder Circle.\n8\tThe Elder Circle lies to the south-east of the Stone-grove. Glahíril suggested that you meditate within the Elder Circle.\t\n9\tTalk to Galhíril in Egladil\tGalhíril is in Egladil. You should return to Galhiril and tell her of your meditations within the circles of Lothlórien.\n",
[3414]="7001BAB2\n1\tBring the craban-eyes to Candaith\030Collect craban-eyes (total: 8)\tCrebain can be found throughout the Weather Hills. Candaith's camp is at the foot of Weathertop in the Lone-lands. Candaith directed you to seek out and destroy the crebain found throughout the immediate areas surrounding his camp. He believes that they are here at the behest of some unseen master and that they will report all they have seen.\n",
[3415]="70030413\n1\tDefeat Mordor Warg-riders (total: 6)\030Defeat Mordor Corruptors (total: 4)\tWinsig mentioned that numerous riders are patrolling the recently sacked crofts of Walstow. Mounted Orcs of Mordor can be found to the west and south-west of Walstow.\n2\tTalk to Winsig\tWinsig can be found inside the mead-hall of Walstow.\n",
[3416]="7003FF46\n1\tDefeat Blackroot mountain-lions (total: 8)\tBlackroot mountain-lions can be found to the east of Alagrant and as far south as Sardol. You have encountered aggressive mountain-lions in the vale, and should cull their numbers for the good of Alagrant and Sardol.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have slain many mountain-lions in Blackroot Vale.\n",
[3417]="70019D23\n1\tTalk to Randiron near Telain Galadhrim\tRandiron is in Telain Galadhrim, beneath the flet on which the trainers reside, down the western path and along the first right turn. Trevadiel told you to seek Randiron to learn more of the ways of Caras Galadhon.\n2\tTalk to Rainen at Telain Galadhrim\tRainen is at Telain Galadhrim, the flet upon which the trainers reside, up the winding steps from Randiron. Randiron has told you to speak with his friend Rainen.\n3\tTalk to Padril at Telain Galadhrim\tPadril can be found at Telain Galadhrim, on the level above Rainen, reached by climbing the ladder. Rainen has asked you to speak with her friend Padril.\n",
[3418]="70040ED6\n1\tTalk to a guard outside the eastern gate of Dol Amroth\tThe city of Dol Amroth can be found to the west of Ost Lontir. Gilanor has asked you to offer your services to the people of Dol Amroth.\n",
[3419]="70036AD1\n1\tDefeat the trolls\tProtect the civilians at the central camp and defeat the trolls. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[3420]="700380E5\n1\tDefeat the trolls\tProtect the civilians at the central camp and defeat the trolls.\n",
[3421]="7000EF94\n1\tBring the Jewel of Ice to Esko at Pynti-peldot\030Collect the Jewel of Ice\tRoibeard is at the Angmarim encampments near the Ironspan, north-east of Pynti-peldot. Esko has told you where the Angmarim are holding the Jewel of Ice. You must retrieve it before it can be returned to the vaults of Angmar.\n",
[3422]="700173B1\n1\tHelp Raf drive the Uruks out of the Forges\030Assist Sigir in his reclamation efforts\030Assist Sigir in his effort to recover stolen tools\tRaf and Sigir are at Anazârmekhem. Pálmar asked you to speak with Raf and Sigir and to assist them in clearing the Forges of Khazad-dûm.\n2\tTalk to Pálmar at Anazârmekhem\tPálmar is at Anazârmekhem, north-east of the Forges of Khazad-dûm. You assisted both Raf and Sigir with their tasks and should now speak to Pálmar to obtain his favour with Narfi.\n",
[3423]="70034D7A\n1\tDefeat Clampjaw\tClampjaw stalks the frozen ponds in the northern Writhendowns. You should defeat Clampjaw.\n2\tDefeat Clampjaw\tClampjaw stalks the frozen ponds in the northern Writhendowns. You should defeat Clampjaw.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Clampjaw, a menace to all who ventured too near the barghest-infested ponds of the Writhendowns.\n",
[3424]="70057807\n1\tDefeat cave-claws in Scraper's Clough\tCave-claws have long inhabited the area known as Scraper's Clough, scraping their horns upon the sides of that rocky crag. You should put an end to the danger they pose.\n2\tDefeat cave-claws in Scraper's Clough (total: 10)\tCave-claws have long inhabited the area known as Scraper's Clough, scraping their horns upon the sides of that rocky crag. They pose a deadly threat to the unwary unfortunates who might enter the Clough. You should put an end to the danger they pose.\n3\tCompleted\tCompleted.\n",
